{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q218820","formula":"C₁₆H₂₁N₃O₂","hill":"C16H21N3O2","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":16.0,"H":21.0,"N":3.0,"O":2.0},"names":{"en":"Zolmitriptan","uk":"Золмітріптан"},"descriptions":{"en":"Zolmitriptan, sold under the brand name Zomig among others, is a serotonergic medication which is used in the acute treatment of migraine attacks with or without aura and cluster headaches. It is taken by mouth as a swallowed or disintegrating tablet or as a nasal spray. Side effects include tightness in the neck or throat, jaw pain, dizziness, paresthesia, asthenia, somnolence, warm/cold sensations, nausea, chest pressure, and dry mouth.","uk":"Золмітриптан — селективний агоніст рекомбінантних 5-НТ1В/1D-рецепторів серотоніну судин людини для лікування нападів мігрені з аурою і без аури. Застосовується перорально або інтраназально. Терапевтичний ефект розвивається впродовж 15-20 хвилин після застосування з максимумом дії через 1 годину."},"fame":20,"pubchemCid":60857,"mass":287.36,"charge":0,"smiles":"CN(C)CCC1=CNC2=C1C=C(C=C2)C[C@H]3COC(=O)N3","inchikey":"ULSDMUVEXKOYBU-ZDUSSCGKSA-N","iupac":"(4S)-4-[[3-[2-(dimethylamino)ethyl]-1H-indol-5-yl]methyl]-1,3-oxazolidin-2-one","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"60857","atoms":42,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-5.131,"y":1.188,"z":-0.038,"el":"O"},{"x":-4.146,"y":2.692,"z":-1.459,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.943,"y":0.961,"z":-0.474,"el":"N"},{"x":2.344,"y":-2.945,"z":-0.781,"el":"N"},{"x":4.067,"y":2.56,"z":0.221,"el":"N"},{"x":-3.272,"y":-0.197,"z":0.294,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.244,"y":-0.522,"z":1.36,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.052,"y":-1.227,"z":0.801,"el":"C"},{"x":1.161,"y":-1.151,"z":-0.18,"el":"C"},{"x":2.409,"y":-0.727,"z":-0.717,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.63,"y":0.175,"z":0.853,"el":"C"},{"x":1.146,"y":-2